jpg 768w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/victorian-img8b-618x464.jpg 618w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/victorian-img8b-100x75.jpg 100w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/victorian-img8b.jpg 900w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
